{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは(。--。)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2076933/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うきゃーっっイベントいっぱい乃木充、川後です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現代の女子高校生用語は、すごいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・リア充　・シア充　があります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでもいいなら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＋乃木充　と　うな重"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を入れていただきたいところ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にももっと凄い用語発見\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・きらり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└目が、アニメ「きらりんレボリューション」のきらりちゃんのように大きいこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例）まいやん、目がきらりしてる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぇ？これ使い方あってますかね？現役高校生さーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2076933/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・チョコンバ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└超コンディションバッドの略。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例）今日のイベント大雨とかチョコンバだね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーっと、チョコンバ？おいしそうな感じが...。あっ、チョコではないんですね；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいなΣ('ω'ｏ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一年後、女子高校生だよー＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後は、多分１年後も女子高校生用語はつかえませんね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むしろ、きらりとかチョコンバを使っている女子高校生がいるのかも険しいところ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５月３日〜みちのく合衆国〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨の中わざわざ足を運んでくれた方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家で応援してくれてた方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてみて少しでも気になってくれた方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2076933/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2076933/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悪天候にも関わらず、みなさん足を止めてみてくださって本当に嬉しかったです(; ;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、なんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーの「狼に口笛を」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様の前で初披露(*´ー｀*)◎。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだだなと感じたけれど、凄くたのしかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次披露するときまでの課題が出来た。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声援ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５月４日〜イオン羽生握手会〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・かずみん・美雲ちゃん・なーちゃん・ひな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この４人！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イオンに遊びに来てた家族さんとかお友達同士とかが沢山いてまた多くの人に知ってもらえたかな？って思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂応援に来て下さった方もありがとうございます！(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ嬉しいです( ^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４月５日〜かずみんとデート〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、かずみんとデート"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2076933/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2076933/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/KWG.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2076933/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の計画はUFOキャッチャーが目的。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だったんですがー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリクラ撮る。お洋服みる。クレープ食べる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"といった感じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2076933/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ楽しい(*´｀*)///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんブログにも書いてたけどね、ユニット組むなら「飴と鞭」なんやって〜(*´−`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ組みたいなあ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、かずみんとひなは、よく道重さゆみさんの話するんよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2076933/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、かずみんの家でハロプロのDVD一緒にみたんよー＊。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに昨日、イオン握手会終わりにかずみん家行ったー＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆうさＴおそろで買おうっち計画しよんっちゃん(｀・ω・)あぁ、コンサート行きたい。切実に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"道重さんはモモクロさんのコンサート行ったらしい。ああ羨ましい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モモクロさんも好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、ずっと握手会帰りにずっと１人でモモクロさんの動画をみてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンス凄いなーと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後ももっと頑張ろうと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ぐぐたす300更新指原さんお疲れ様です＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"尊敬。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと300すべて読みました＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーセーラー服着てみたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セーラー服の子にめっちゃ萌える！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"nyny。hshs。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うきゃーっ！(爆)(爆)(笑)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、更新できなくて